      "init": {
        "label": "Daily notes as a time series",
        "body": "# Your daily notes as a time series\n\nWith the daily-notes date format set, **Vault Folder** reads each file name into a `date` column, so a folder of daily notes sorts like a series. A 7-day **rolling average** smooths the nightly sleep, and the line shows the trend under the noise.\n\nWith no vault folder set in Settings, the reader uses the bundled sample vault; point it at your own and the same chain takes over once the columns match.",
